      {
        "id": 17157,
        "title": "Konsol",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145149,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Baris kode adalah <strong>instruksi</strong> yang harus diikuti oleh game.</p><p>Saat kita menjalankan kode, kita memberi tahu game untuk mengikuti instruksi yang kita susun.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145150,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Urutan instruksi penting karena game mengikuti instruksi tersebut baris demi baris.</p><p>Buat <code>step1</code> terlebih dahulu, <code>step2</code> kedua, dan <code>step3</code> ketiga.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Start game loop&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Win level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const step1 = \"Spawn player\";</code>, diikuti oleh <code>const step2 = \"Start game loop\";</code>, dan terakhir <code>const step3 = \"Win level\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145151,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan instruksi khusus <code>console.log()</code>, kita memberi tahu komputer untuk menampilkan sebuah nilai di area yang disebut <strong>console</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game started!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Game started!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145152,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa menggunakan instruksi <code>console.log()</code> sesering yang kita mau. Komputer menampilkan setiap nilai pada satu baris di console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loading level...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;GO!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145153,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga bisa menggunakan <code>console.log()</code> untuk menampilkan variabel seperti <code>playerState</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>playerState</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145154,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita menampilkan variabel di konsol, nilainya akan muncul, bukan namanya. Jika kita mencatat <code>enemyName</code> di sini, nilainya akan ditampilkan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>enemyName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145155,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita tahu bahwa <code>\"Game started!\"</code> adalah string?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Dimulai dan diakhiri dengan tanda kutip ganda</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Ini berisi huruf dan simbol</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dimulai dan diakhiri dengan tanda kutip ganda.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145156,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa itu console?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Area yang menampilkan output</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Area tempat kita menulis kode</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Area yang menampilkan output.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145157,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa fungsi instruksi khusus <code>console.log()</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Menampilkan sebuah nilai di console</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Ini membuat sebuah variabel</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menampilkan sebuah nilai di console.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145158,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dungeon 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Dungeon 1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelName</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Dungeon 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145159,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Susun kode agar menampilkan nilai <code>100</code> di console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const playerHealth = 100;</code>, diikuti oleh <code>console.log(playerHealth);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145160,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan instruksi untuk menampilkan nilai string ini di console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level up!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>console</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>log</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
